3. Convert the image to grayscale.
4. Apply a Gaussian filter to the grayscale image.
5. Apply the Sobel operator to the filtered image.
6. Display the edge image.

Here's the modified code:

```matlab
% Import necessary functions
function edgeImage = sobelEdgeDetection(inputImage)
    grayImage = rgb2gray(inputImage);
    gaussianFilteredImage = gaussianFilter(grayImage, [5 5], 'symmetric');
    sobelEdges = sobelOperator(gaussianFilteredImage);
    edgeImage = squeeze(sobelEdges);
end

% Load input image
inputImage = imread('image.jpg');

% Apply Sobel edge detection with Gaussian filter
edgeImage = sobelEdgeDetection(inputImage);

% Display edge image
imshow(edgeImage);
```

