  "port": 80,
  "payload": "Hello World"
};

const protocol = determineProtocol(inputData);
console.log(`The most relevant protocol for this input data is ${protocol}.`);
```

This function will analyze the input data and return the most relevant protocol based on the source and destination IP addresses, port number, and payload. If none of the specified protocol

